sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager as "Manager/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (manager.shift-swap-approvals.index)"
    participant Controller as "ShiftSwapApprovalController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Manager->>View: Klik Export (PDF/Excel/CSV)
    View->>Controller: GET /manager/shift-swap-approvals/export?filter&format
    Controller->>Model: Build filter export
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_requests + relasi sesuai filter
    DB-->>Model: Dataset export
    Model-->>Controller: Data siap ekspor

    alt Data valid (format & data valid)
        Controller->>View: Return file (pdf/xlsx/csv)
        View-->>Manager: File unduhan berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (format tidak valid/query gagal)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Manager: Notifikasi gagal ekspor
    end
